### 1. Create a new class (Admin / School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "gradeLevel": "Grade 5",
  "stream": "East",
  "classTeacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "academicYear": "2026"
}

### 2. List all classes for a school (Any Authenticated User: Admin, Teacher, Student, Parent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/school/{{schoolId}}?academicYear=2026
Cookie: token={{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 3. Get a specific class by ID (Any Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}
Cookie: token={{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 4. Update class details (Admin / School Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "gradeLevel": "Grade 5",
  "stream": "Eest",
  "academicYear": "2026"
}

### 5. Assign or change class teacher (Admin / School Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/teacher
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "classTeacherId": "{{teacherId}}"
}

### 6. Delete a class (Super Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}